<title>LITHUANIA: GRAFOBAL POSTS H1 97 641,000 LITAS NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>GRAFOBAL POSTS H1 97 641,000 LITAS NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997</p>
<p>				  (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   641,000    vs losses 274,000</p>
<p>    Turnover		     13.48	vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Operating costs	    8.92	 vs 6.51</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   848,000    vs losses 223,000</p>
<p>Profit from ordinary</p>
<p>    activities		   749,000    vs losses 278,000</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     779,000    vs losses 274,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Grafobal is a paper packaging producer and</p>
<p>is on the A group of the Vilnius bourse.</p>
<p>Grafobal reported 15,000 litas net profit for 1996.</p>
<p>The company exported around 40 percent of its products in</p>
<p>the first half of 1997, 80 percent of it to Belarus and the</p>
<p>rest to Russia and Latvia.</p>
<p>Grafobal is a 78 percent Slovak owned company.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
